    "detailed_description": "This is a traditional turn-based RPG game made with RMMV, so the game will be very plain, with no flashy standing graphics and scenes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe theme is based on the Romance of the Three Kingdoms, and the characters are completely feminine, of course, this is not an R18 game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlike a classic game, it does not use a troop system, but a traditional Japanese RPG class system, with a total of 30+ collectible generals and 12 classes...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach general corresponds to 1 class and five element attributes, although it will still lead to the strength of high-value generals, but low-value generals can also be used...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI wanted to release it as a free game, but life is really stretched, and I don't think the quality of this game is high, so please be cautious when buying...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter that, I'll be working on two more games in production, so stay tuned...",
    "about_the_game": "This is a traditional turn-based RPG game made with RMMV, so the game will be very plain, with no flashy standing graphics and scenes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe theme is based on the Romance of the Three Kingdoms, and the characters are completely feminine, of course, this is not an R18 game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlike a classic game, it does not use a troop system, but a traditional Japanese RPG class system, with a total of 30+ collectible generals and 12 classes...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach general corresponds to 1 class and five element attributes, although it will still lead to the strength of high-value generals, but low-value generals can also be used...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI wanted to release it as a free game, but life is really stretched, and I don't think the quality of this game is high, so please be cautious when buying...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter that, I'll be working on two more games in production, so stay tuned...",
    "short_description": "It's a traditional turn-based Japanese RPG! The game starts with the &quot;Liu Bei&quot; Yellow Turban Uprising, goes through the battle of Chibi, collects Xichuan, and ends with the end of the world as the story line... The overall gameplay is about 20 hours!",
